<title>UK: SCOTTISH MEDIA HAS 89.9 PCT OF GRAMPIAN.</title>
<headline>SCOTTISH MEDIA HAS 89.9 PCT OF GRAMPIAN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish Media Group Plc said on Friday it had effective control over about 89.9 percent of Grampian Television Plc's shares, including a 19.9 percent stake it already agreed to buy.</p>
<p>As of Thursday, Scottish Media had received acceptances representing about 23.0 million shares, or 70 percent of Grampian.</p>
<p>Scottish Media extended its 105 million stg bid for Grampian until August 14.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
